`SelectionCheckbox` is not exported from the package root? Let me check the components/index.d.ts exports. The docs INDEX.md said `import {RangedSelectionCheckbox, SelectionCheckbox} from '@gravity-ui/table'` — but the installed version's root index.d.ts exports list (line 1 earlier) showed: BaseTable, ReorderingProvider, ColumnReorderingProvider, ColumnReorderingContext, SortIndicator, Table, TableSettings, SortableListContext, DraggableRowContext, ExperimentalRowLink, TreeExpandableCell, RangedSelectionCheckbox — no SelectionCheckbox! The docs snapshot may be from a different minor. Per skill: trust the installed version.

So use `RangedSelectionCheckbox`? It needs `cellContext` prop. Or use uikit `Checkbox` directly with row handlers — the INDEX.md "Custom Ranged Selection Column" example uses plain uikit `Checkbox` with a hook for range; without range, plain Checkbox works:

```tsx
cell: ({row}) => (
    <Checkbox
        size="l"
        checked={row.getIsSelected()}
        disabled={!row.getCanSelect()}
        indeterminate={row.getIsSomeSelected()}
        onChange={row.getToggleSelectedHandler()}
    />
),
```

Let me verify SelectionCheckbox is truly not exported (grep) and whether RangedSelectionCheckbox is exported (yes, line 1). RangedSelectionCheckbox requires cellContext prop; on grouped (nested) tables ranged selection is undefined behavior, so plain uikit Checkbox is the right call. Use Checkbox from uikit.

